# Mira Sykes walks a round through the house every hour: hall, Faust's study, kitchen, the gate.

%rec: slots

day: every_hour
time: 00:00
map: mansion
location: mansion_hall
description: standing in the hall, one hand near her holster

day: every_hour
time: 00:15
map: mansion
location: faust_study
description: checking on Faust

day: every_hour
time: 00:30
map: mansion
location: mansion_kitchen
description: looking over the kitchen and the service door

day: every_hour
time: 00:45
map: mansion
location: mansion_gate
description: having a word with the gate guards
